# Sync New Blocks/Items to Game Encyclopedia

When adding or removing any block or item content, keep the Game Encyclopedia updated in the same change.

## Required Updates

- Update data definitions (for example `src/data/blocks.js`, `src/data/items.js`).
- Update runtime/generated textures if needed (for example `src/scenes/BootScene.js`).
- Update encyclopedia pages:
  - `item-inventory.html`
  - `public/item-inventory.html`
- Ensure the new/changed entry appears in the correct section with:
  - name
  - visual/icon
  - details/tags (tool type, hardness, drop/recipe, etc.)

## Completion Check

Before finishing, confirm:

- No new block/item exists only in gameplay code.
- No new block/item exists only in encyclopedia pages.
- Encyclopedia entries match actual in-game behavior and visuals.
